@startuml sequence_diagram_open_viewer
autonumber
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Sequence Diagram - VIS01 Opening the 3D Kitchen Viewer inside the SPA

actor User as "Restaurant Staff /\nLaPrizza Manager"
participant Slot as "ModulePage\n(WEB01 module slot)"
participant Auth as "AuthProvider\n(AA03 / WEB03)"
participant Page as "KitchenViewerPage\n(lazy chunk)"
participant Viewer as "KitchenViewer"
participant GL as "webglSupport"
participant Loader as "kitchenViewerLoader"
participant VApi as "kitchenViewerApi"
participant Req as "ModuleRequest\n+ apiClient (WEB01)"
participant BE as "Back-End API\nGET /kitchen-configurations/active\n(WEB06)"
participant Parser as "activeConfigurationParser"
participant Assets as "SceneAssetLoader"
participant Files as "Asset files\n/kitchen-assets/files/*"
participant Engine as "ViewerEngine"

note over User, Engine
    The viewer is rendered INSIDE the common layout (WEB02). WEB06 owns the endpoint, the JSON format
    and the viewer contract (usWEB06 3.4.5); VIS01 implements the viewer and its states.
    Every error branch ENDS the interaction: no partial scene, no previous scene, no embedded layout.
    401 / 403 are handled ONCE by WEB03 (Table B) inside ModuleRequest before VIS01 sees the error.
    Engine failures (renderer, build, update, render, context loss): sequence_diagram_engine_failure.
end note

== 1. Navigation, permission check and lazy loading (WEB01 / WEB03, unchanged) ==

User -> Slot : selects "Kitchen viewer" in the menu\n(or types /kitchen/viewer)
activate Slot
Slot -> Auth : ProtectedRoute(section "kitchen-viewer")\n+ refresh() before mounting
activate Auth
Auth --> Slot : roles
deactivate Auth

alt A) Guest / role without MANAGER or EMPLOYEE / denied account
    Slot --> User : login redirect or AccessDeniedPage (WEB03)
    note right of Slot : interaction ends: the "three" chunk is NOT\ndownloaded and no data request is sent
else B) MANAGER or EMPLOYEE
    Slot -> Page : lazy(() => import("./visualization/KitchenViewerPage.jsx"))\n<Page request={request} />
    activate Page
    note right of Slot : "Loading section..." while the chunk downloads;\nan import / render failure is contained by\nModuleErrorBoundary with "Try again"
    Page -> Viewer : <KitchenViewer request modules=[defaults] />
    activate Viewer
    Viewer --> User : state "loading" (WEB04 loading indicator)

    == 2. Capability check ==

    Viewer -> GL : isWebGLAvailable()
    activate GL
    GL --> Viewer : true / false
    deactivate GL

    alt B1) WebGL not available
        Viewer --> User : state "unsupported":\n"Your browser cannot display 3D content (WebGL)."
        note right of Viewer : interaction ends: no request, no renderer;\nthe rest of the SPA keeps working
    else B2) WebGL available

        == 3. Active configuration (usWEB06 3.4.2 / 3.4.5) ==

        Viewer -> Loader : loadActiveKitchen(request, signal)
        activate Loader
        Loader -> VApi : getActive(request, signal)
        activate VApi
        VApi -> Req : request("GET", "/kitchen-configurations/active", { signal })
        activate Req
        Req -> BE : GET /api/v1/kitchen-configurations/active\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
        activate BE
        BE --> Req : 200 / 401 / 403 / 404 / 5xx
        deactivate BE

        alt C1) 401
            Req -> Auth : handleAuthFailure(401) (WEB03 Table B)
            activate Auth
            Auth --> User : clear(); status guest;\nredirect /login?returnTo=/kitchen/viewer
            deactivate Auth
            Req --> VApi : throw ApiError{401}
            VApi --> Loader : ApiError{401}
            Loader --> Viewer : state "expired"
            Viewer -> Viewer : renders nothing; no logout,\nno navigation, no message
            note right of Viewer : interaction ends: ONE reaction, owned by WEB03
        else C2) 403
            Req -> Auth : handleAuthFailure(403) -> refresh() once (single flight)
            activate Auth
            Auth --> Req : roles re-read from GET /auth/me
            deactivate Auth
            alt C2a) Account denied / neither MANAGER nor EMPLOYEE remains
                Slot --> User : WEB03 replaces the page by AccessDeniedPage\n(viewer unmounted, its state discarded)
            else C2b) Same roles or a permitted role remains
                Slot --> Viewer : keep route allowed; rebuild menu if roles changed
                Req --> VApi : throw original ApiError{403}
                VApi --> Loader : ApiError{403}
                Loader --> Viewer : state "denied"
                alt Same roles
                    Viewer --> User : WEB04 error inside the viewer area:\n"You do not have permission to perform this operation."
                else Roles changed, EMPLOYEE remains
                    Viewer --> User : one WEB04 permission message
                end
            end
            note right of Viewer : interaction ends: never a logout on 403,\nnever two denied messages
        else C3) 404 with details[].code = "NO_ACTIVE_CONFIGURATION" (VIS-ALN-1)
            Req --> VApi : throw ApiError{404, details}
            VApi --> Loader : ApiError{404, details}
            Loader --> Viewer : state "empty"
            Viewer --> User : "No kitchen configuration is active.\nA Manager must activate one."
            note right of Viewer : interaction ends: NO default layout
        else C4) 404 without that code (route missing, wrong base URL),\n5xx, network, timeout, invalid-response
            Req --> VApi : throw ApiError{status, kind}
            VApi --> Loader : ApiError
            Loader --> Viewer : state "error" (reason "request")
            Viewer --> User : "The kitchen viewer is unavailable." + [Retry]
            note right of Viewer : interaction ends: an integration fault is\nnever shown as an empty kitchen (BR 13)
        else C5) 200 OK
            Req --> VApi : body
            deactivate Req
            VApi --> Loader : body
            deactivate VApi
            Loader -> Parser : parseActiveConfiguration(body)
            activate Parser
            alt C5a) status != ACTIVE, schemaVersion != 1, units != meters,\nbad dimensions, unresolved / wrong-kind asset id, non-http(s) url
                Parser --> Loader : throws
                Loader --> Viewer : state "invalid"
                Viewer --> User : "The active kitchen configuration\ncannot be displayed."
                note right of Viewer : interaction ends: fail closed
            else C5b) valid
                Parser --> Loader : ActiveKitchenConfigurationDTO
                deactivate Parser
                Loader --> Viewer : state "loading-assets" (configuration)
                deactivate Loader

                == 4. All-or-nothing asset preloading (usWEB06 3.4.5 steps 3-4) ==

                Viewer --> User : "Loading 3D models and textures..."
                Viewer -> Assets : preloadAll(configuration.assets,\n{ signal, timeoutMs: 30000 })
                activate Assets
                par every entry of assets
                    Assets -> Files : GET <url> (public, CORS)
                    activate Files
                    Files --> Assets : 200 bytes / 404
                    deactivate Files
                    Assets -> Assets : decode (GLTFLoader / TextureLoader)
                end
                alt D1) A file failed (404, decode error) or the 30 s timeout expired
                    Assets -> Assets : cancel the others;\ndispose everything already loaded
                    Assets --> Viewer : throw AssetLoadError{ assetId }
                    Viewer --> User : state "error" (reason "asset-unavailable"):\n"The 3D file AST-MDL-OVEN-DOME-01 of the active\nconfiguration is unavailable." + [Retry]
                    note right of Viewer : interaction ends: no renderer was created
                else D2) Every asset loaded
                    Assets --> Viewer : LoadedAssets
                    deactivate Assets

                    == 5. Scene creation and rendering ==

                    Viewer -> Viewer : createElement("canvas"); append to viewport
                    Viewer -> Engine : ViewerEngine.create(canvas, viewport, { onFatalError })
                    activate Engine
                    Engine -> Engine : renderer, scene, camera,\nResizeObserver, contextlost listener
                    Engine --> Viewer : engine
                    Viewer -> Viewer : assign engine to the effect's local variable
                    Viewer -> Engine : await load(configuration, loadedAssets,\nmoduleFactories, signal)
                    Engine -> Engine : take ownership of the loaded assets;\nframe the floor with the camera
                    Engine -> Engine : for each factory: register module,\nthen build(SceneContext with signal)
                    Engine --> Viewer : true (build complete)
                    Viewer -> Engine : start()
                    Engine -> Engine : render first frame; setAnimationLoop(frame)
                    Engine --> Viewer : true
                    Viewer --> User : state "ready": scene of "Extended assembly line"\n(KCF-00002, version 4) inside the SPA layout + [Reload]
                    deactivate Engine
                end
            end
        end
    end
    deactivate Viewer
    deactivate Page
end
deactivate Slot

@enduml
